<div style="background:#0002;padding:1em;font-family:rubik;border-left:5px solid #006db1">
<span style="font-size:24px;color:#006db1">'''ABOUT THE WIKI AND THE GAME'''</span><br>
This is the wiki about the video game ''Idle Skilling'' that anybody can edit. It plans to document all of the content that can be found in the game.

Idle Skilling is a free game developed by Lavaflame2 available [https://store.steampowered.com/app/1048370/Idle_Skilling/ on Steam], on the [https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.lavaflame.IdleSkilling Google Play Store], and [https://apps.apple.com/us/app/idle-skilling-rpg-tycoon/id1479807294 App Store]. 
</div>

